   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: try the methods in order, stop at the first that works",
   "originalText": "The rule: try the methods in order, stop at the first that works",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b20-text-8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 330,
   "width": 594,
   "height": 150,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 63352,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 837832,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Dest  Via  ECMP  LFA   Remote LFA      TI-LFA labels   Credited to\n----  ---  ----  ----  --------------  --------------  -----------\nPE2   P1   yes   P2    not run         16004 16012     ECMP\nPE2   P2   yes   P1    not run         16003 16012     ECMP\nP4    P2   no    P1    not run         16004           LFA\nP1    P1   no    none  PQ PE2 via P2   24000 16001     Remote LFA\nP2    P2   no    none  PQ P4 via P1    24000 16002     Remote LFA\nP3    P1   no    none  PQ PE2 via P2   16004 16003     Remote LFA",
   "originalText": "Dest  Via  ECMP  LFA   Remote LFA      TI-LFA labels   Credited to\n----  ---  ----  ----  --------------  --------------  -----------\nPE2   P1   yes   P2    not run         16004 16012     ECMP\nPE2   P2   yes   P1    not run         16003 16012     ECMP\nP4    P2   no    P1    not run         16004           LFA\nP1    P1   no    none  PQ PE2 via P2   24000 16001     Remote LFA\nP2    P2   no    none  PQ P4 via P1    24000 16002     Remote LFA\nP3    P1   no    none  PQ PE2 via P2   16004 16003     Remote LFA",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b20-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 490,
   "width": 977,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every row also has a TI-LFA repair, and the ECMP rows also have an LFA. Each row still counts once, under the\nfirst method that works. \"Not run\": Remote LFA is only tried when there is no LFA (B13).",
   "originalText": "Every row also has a TI-LFA repair, and the ECMP rows also have an LFA. Each row still counts once, under the\nfirst method that works. \"Not run\": Remote LFA is only tried when there is no LFA (B13).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b20-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 540,
   "width": 968,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 3 adds the fourth step: from S, all 4 destinations have no LFA and no PQ node, so all 4 go to TI-LFA\n(S → C: 16004, 24005, 16005).",
   "originalText": "Example 3 adds the fourth step: from S, all 4 destinations have no LFA and no PQ node, so all 4 go to TI-LFA\n(S → C: 16004, 24005, 16005).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
